		"A large spider type monster. It lurks underground or in caves. After being named, it can be equipped with a monster saddle and ridden. Using the Race/Mount Ability key (default R), while riding it causes it to shoot out its Sticky Steel Thread with a large arc. When ridden or pursuing a player, it will break leaves and logs in its way. Holding the jump key, much like a horse will charge a jump bar allowing the spider to go around 10 blocks in the air."
		""
		"Deeper parts of the forests and jungles are being occupied by massive, venomous arachnids. Cleanse the woods."
		""
		"Found in Plains, Jungles, and Forests. They have slightly boosted health and movement speed compared to vanilla spiders, acting as an early-game gear check."
