		""
		"&7Health &f+7490   &7Spiritual Health &f+74970"
		"&7Aura &f45,000,000   &7Magicule &f5,000,000"
		"&7Attack &f+20   &7Attack Speed &f+3"
		"---------------------------------"
		"&7Against &fHeavenly Restriction&7: &a+6755 HP, +70470 SH, +15.5 ATK"
		""
		"Every other road to divinity goes through magic. This one goes through a body that was never given any. The curse that sealed a Heavenly Restriction off from magicules stopped being a cage the moment the flesh under it outgrew what magic could have done anyway. It asks nothing of the world and gives the world no opening. Awakened - as Demon Lord or as Hero, the curse does not care which - and fed on dragon essence, it is a divine lifeform."
	]
	quest.A42C1BEAB5DF6296.quest_subtitle: "Evolves from Heavenly Restriction"
	quest.A42C1BEAB5DF6296.title: "The Unyielding Might"
	chapter.B3A5B75633DF4CC5.title: "&7[Path of the Restricted]"
	quest.B7EA9600EFF3A274.quest_desc: [
		"---------------------------------"
		"&7A starting race. This is where the path begins."
		""
		"&7Health &f-12   &7Spiritual Health &f-4"
		"&7Aura &f250   &7Magicule &f1,200"
		"&7Attack &f-0.5   &7Attack Speed &f+3.5"
		"---------------------------------"
		"An ancient family of sculk inhabitants, where evolution has given them permanent darkness. Starts off weak, but grows to become a monstrosity."
		""
		"&e> This race has its own chapter. The path continues there."
	]
	quest.B7EA9600EFF3A274.quest_subtitle: "Starting race"
	quest.B7EA9600EFF3A274.title: "Sculk Worm"
	quest.A974B81DB7E198BA.quest_desc: [
		"---------------------------------"
		"&7Requires &f4,000 EP"
		""
		"&7Health &f+22.5   &7Spiritual Health &f+95"
		"&7Aura &f5,000   &7Magicule &f2,500"
		"&7Attack &f+1.5   &7Attack Speed &f+0.75"
		"---------------------------------"
		"&7Against &fSculk Worm&7: &a+34.5 HP, +99 SH, +2 ATK"
		""
		"The worm went down instead of out, and found the cold before it found the bottom."
	]
	quest.A974B81DB7E198BA.quest_subtitle: "Evolves from Sculk Worm"
	quest.A974B81DB7E198BA.title: "Deeper Shrieker"
	quest.AE69171D55A8F1B8.quest_desc: [
		"---------------------------------"
		"&7Requires &f100,000 EP"
		""
		"&7Health &f+50   &7Spiritual Health &f+150"
		"&7Aura &f37,500   &7Magicule &f37,500"
