		"---------------------------------"
		"&7Against &fMolten Perforator&7: &a+35 HP, +105 SH, +1.6 ATK"
		""
		"\"And his brother loved worms...\" A powerful evolved variant of the sculk worm, gaining a long, worm-like appendage."
	]
	quest.AE69171D55A8F1B8.quest_subtitle: "Evolves from Molten Perforator"
	quest.AE69171D55A8F1B8.title: "Magma Worm"
	quest.89CEA8A882204853.quest_desc: [
		"---------------------------------"
		"&7Requires &f100,000 EP"
		""
		"&7Health &f+90   &7Spiritual Health &f+235"
		"&7Aura &f50,000   &7Magicule &f50,000"
		"&7Attack &f+1.5   &7Attack Speed &f+0.2"
		"---------------------------------"
		"&7Against &fCharged Perforator&7: &a+62.5 HP, +100 SH, -3.5 ATK"
		""
		"\"The Reminder.\" When two brothers played, this one watched."
	]
	quest.89CEA8A882204853.quest_subtitle: "Evolves from Charged Perforator"
	quest.89CEA8A882204853.title: "Overloading Worm"
	quest.8628F94069148CE8.quest_desc: [
		"---------------------------------"
		"&7Requires &f2,000,000 EP"
		""
		"&7Health &f+490   &7Spiritual Health &f+3400"
		"&7Aura &f500,000   &7Magicule &f500,000"
		"&7Attack &f+3   &7Attack Speed &f+0.5"
		"---------------------------------"
		"&7Against &fEnflamed Aberration&7: &a+200 HP, +3110 SH, -1 ATK"
		""
		"What was once a sculk worm has truly disappeared. This is a monstrosity and there is no going back. It has achieved divinity, possessing an immortal physical body that will never age."
	]
	quest.8628F94069148CE8.quest_subtitle: "Evolves from Enflamed Aberration"
	quest.8628F94069148CE8.title: "Violence Deity"
	quest.A7656EB914B6257F.quest_desc: [
		"---------------------------------"
		"&7Requires &f2,000,000 EP"
		""
		"&7Health &f+540   &7Spiritual Health &f+3725"
		"&7Aura &f500,000   &7Magicule &f500,000"
		"&7Attack &f+5   &7Attack Speed &f+1.2"
		"---------------------------------"
		"&7Against &fLightning Aberration&7: &a+175 HP, +3425 SH, +1.5 ATK"
		""
		"What was once a sculk worm has truly disappeared. \"The beast stretched from one horizon to the next and belched storms that reminded all of the hero’s promise: that this land – and all those who live here - would never suffer again...\" It has achieved divinity, possessing an immortal physical body that will never age."
	]
	quest.A7656EB914B6257F.quest_subtitle: "Evolves from Lightning Aberration"
	quest.A7656EB914B6257F.title: "Dissonance Deity"
	quest.B6985A323B4FBBF8.quest_desc: [
		"---------------------------------"
		"&7Requires &f50,000,000 EP"
		""
		"&7Health &f+2240   &7Spiritual Health &f+27470"
		"&7Aura &f45,000,000   &7Magicule &f5,000,000"
		"&7Attack &f+20   &7Attack Speed &f+3"
		"---------------------------------"
		"&7Against &fViolence Deity&7: &a+1750 HP, +24070 SH, +17 ATK"
		""
		"The flame line never learned restraint - it learned rule. What was a Violence Deity stopped burning outward and started burning downward, until the heat had somewhere to sit and a throne grew out of it. It keeps the worm's furnace and the ogre's horns, and wears a crown it forged for itself out of both. Awakened as a Demon Lord, fed on flame essence, it is a divine lifeform."
	]
	quest.B6985A323B4FBBF8.quest_subtitle: "Evolves from Violence Deity"
	quest.B6985A323B4FBBF8.title: "King of Hell"
	chapter.C16043DF323E75FC.title: "&1[Path of the Sculk Worm]"
