	quest.33D4AE7BC6D8F385.quest_desc: [
		"&8&m                                 "
		"&7A starting race. Everything below begins here."
		""
		"&7Health &f-10      &7Spiritual Health &f+15"
		"&7Aura &f500      &7Magicule &f500"
		"&7Attack &f-0.7      &7Attack Speed &f0"
		"&8&m                                 "
		"&oA Spectral race of monster that lacks intelligence and ambition. They’re usually passive but are incredibly ruthless once provoked."
		""
		"&c> A fork: &fMetal Slime&c, &fAbyss Slime&c, &fIntelligent Slime&c."
		"&c> Taking one closes the others for good."
	]
