	quest.0C55FFFE4A154945.quest_desc: [
		"&8&m                                 "
		"&7A starting race. Everything below begins here."
		""
		"&7Health &f0      &7Spiritual Health &f0"
		"&7Aura &f1,140      &7Magicule &f70"
		"&7Attack &f0      &7Attack Speed &f0"
		"&8&m                                 "
		"&oA weak but populous race that relies more on technology and numbers than brute force. Their low magicule count makes skills and magic users a rarity among them, instead favouring battlewill."
		""
		"&c> A fork: &fEnlightened Human&c, &fVampire&c."
		"&c> Taking one closes the others for good."
	]
