		"&7Over &fDivine Elemental&7: &a+1400 HP&7, &a+28655 Spiritual HP&7, &a+18 Attack&7"
		""
		"&oThe elementals never had a ruler, only a direction - each one pulled toward the element that made it and never toward each other. Something at the end of the line finally held all of them at once without being torn apart by the disagreement, and the moment it did, the question of who rules answered itself. Awakened - as Demon Lord or as Hero - and fed on elemental essence, it is a divine lifeform."
		""
		"&6> End of the line. Nothing evolves past this."
	]
