		"&8&m                                 "
		"&7Over &fHeavenly Restriction&7: &a+6755 HP&7, &a+70470 Spiritual HP&7, &a+15.5 Attack&7"
		""
		"&oEvery other road to divinity goes through magic. This one goes through a body that was never given any. The curse that sealed a Heavenly Restriction off from magicules stopped being a cage the moment the flesh under it outgrew what magic could have done anyway. It asks nothing of the world and gives the world no opening. Awakened - as Demon Lord or as Hero, the curse does not care which - and fed on dragon essence, it is a divine lifeform."
		""
		"&6> End of the line. Nothing evolves past this."
	]
